WEBVTT

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:57.580
"Summons"

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:15.830
<i>We want to make it bloom! (our dream)</i>

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:18.290
<i>We want to perform! (in an ensemble)</i>

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:22.910
<i>Let's shine so much that we're blinding</i>

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:26.790
<i>Shine like stars</i>

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:32.080
<i>Wow... let's start running.</i> Wow... to beyond our dream!

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:37.450
<i>Let's make new days. Here we go!</i>

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:42.700
<i>Our feelings that have been made</i> into song are overflowing (Wow Wow)

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:45.450
<i>Facing the dream we're aiming for</i>

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:47.910
<i>(Because I'm sure we can reach it)</i>

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:53.750
<i>You can't start if you don't</i> believe in yourself (This story)

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:58.660
<i>Our feelings resound with each other (We are)</i>

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:02.790
<i>We grow stronger each time we clash</i>

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:04.250
<i>I'm sure that's</i>

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.870
<i>What a bond is...</i>

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:11.160
<i>The smile on your face when you look at me</i>

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:12.620
<i>Gives me</i>

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:13.750
<i>The answer</i>

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:16.450
<i>We want you to know! (the beat of our hearts)</i>

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:18.910
<i>We want to connect! (to the passionate melody)</i>

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:21.750
<i>If you want the future you desire</i>

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:26.700
<i>Then we need to change this into a new world</i>

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:29.450
<i>We are singing a shining song for you.</i>

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:34.000
<i>Shining so much that we're</i> blinding, Stars' Ensemble!

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:37.700
<i>On the stage called "youth"</i>

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:49.750
"Episode 7: Emperor"

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:10.330
"Shinobu Sengoku"

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:04.580
"In light of your victory, we would like to speak
with you in the student council room at noon today."

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:08.580
"Student Council Room"

