00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:42.000
♪ If I conduct ♪

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.500
♪ A melody ♪

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:45.750
♪ More certain ♪

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.160
