♪ Then I'll dedicate it to you ♪

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:51.910
--♪ I'll let you listen to ♪
--♪ this sound yet unknown ♪

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:53.950
--♪ That connects ♪
--♪ eternity ♪

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.290
♪ To the present ♪

